Package: knighttime
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${shlibs:Depends},
Recommends:
 geoclue-2.0,
 libqt6positioning6-plugins,
Description: dark-light cycle scheduling service for GXDE
 KNightTime provides helpers for scheduling the dark-light cycle. It can be
 used to implement features such as adjusting the screen color temperature
 based on time of day.
 .
 This is GXDE's build of KNightTime, ported to the Qt 6.8 and KDE Frameworks
 6.13 stack of GXDE 25. It keeps the upstream and Debian package, library,
 D-Bus and CMake names so that consumers such as gxde-kwin-x11 can use it
 unchanged.
 .
 This package contains the knighttimed D-Bus service (org.kde.NightTime).
 Automatic location needs geoclue and the Qt Positioning plugins.

Package: libknighttime0
Section: libs
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${shlibs:Depends},
Recommends:
 knighttime (= ${binary:Version}),
Description: dark-light cycle scheduling helpers for GXDE - shared library
 KNightTime provides helpers for scheduling the dark-light cycle. It can be
 used to implement features such as adjusting the screen color temperature
 based on time of day.
 .
 This is GXDE's build of KNightTime, ported to the Qt 6.8 and KDE Frameworks
 6.13 stack of GXDE 25.
 .
 This package contains the client library, which subscribes to schedule
 updates from the knighttimed service.

