Description: dark-light cycle scheduling helpers for GXDE - development files
 KNightTime provides helpers for scheduling the dark-light cycle. It can be
 used to implement features such as adjusting the screen color temperature
 based on time of day.
 .
 This is GXDE's build of KNightTime, ported to the Qt 6.8 and KDE Frameworks
 6.13 stack of GXDE 25.
 .
 This package contains the headers and CMake package for the libknighttime
